{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41350","headline":"奉诏赋劒州途中鸷兽 · 王仁裕","name":"奉诏赋劒州途中鸷兽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒牙钉舌血毛腥，窥算劳心岂暂停。\n不与大朝除患难，惟余当路食生灵。\n从将户口资嚵口，未委三丁税几丁。\n今日帝王亲出狩，白云岩下好藏形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}